  "configuration_id": "config_017",
  "reason": "Evidence: config_033 (scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + transformer + weighted, acc 0.7250) is the best so far, and scvi_n200 + transformer + weighted is consistently the strongest combination across encoders. The only untested fusion variant paired with the best image encoder (ViT-L) is concat. With resnet50, weighted beat concat by ~2.5 pp, but ViT-L's higher-dimensional representations might interact differently with concat fusion. This experiment tests whether concat fusion could match or exceed weighted fusion when paired with ViT-L, directly clarifying whether config_033 is truly the peak of the scvi_n200+ViT-L+transformer family. It is the best use of experiment 6 because it exploits the strongest direction with a single-variable change, has low expected cost (~3.5–4 GPU hours, similar to config_033's 3.60), and with 4 experiments remaining, confirming or ruling out this variant lets us either lock in the best config or pivot to exploring alternatives (e.g., singleprofile or PCA encoder) in the remaining budget."
}

